  "description": "The recommended STARTING set for Lyntai — not the whole library (5 of 11 packages). You get: the core library, the default LLM backends (claude/codex CLI, any OpenAI-shaped endpoint for chat + embeddings, an in-process model2vec embedder), both halves of MCP, and IN-MEMORY storage. Two things to know: storage is in-memory, so ADD Lyntai.Storage.Sqlite (or .Postgres) for anything that must survive a restart; and image/video/audio generation is NOT included — add Lyntai.Generation. Also opt-in: Lyntai.Providers.LlamaSharp (local GGUF) and Lyntai.Secrets.Dpapi (Windows). Everything left out is left out because it drags a native payload, a platform-specific API, or a dependency an application that did not ask for that feature should not carry.",
